    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「ふむ。うちの学校はバイトを禁止していませんし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「遊園地での売り子なら、後ろめたくなるようなこともないと思うのですが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「よほど、恐れられているのでしょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ん～、気にしてもしかたないと思うんだけどね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ただし悠木くんはいつも帯刀してるから、そのへんがたぶん、おっかないんじゃないかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「はて。さいきんは刀剣女子も流行っていると聞いたのですが。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「これも流行の先端なのではないでしょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「そうなの？　あたし流行には疎いからさ～、よくわかんないけど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でも、日本刀の造形がかっこいいのはなんとなくわかるっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「ふふ。そうでしょうそうでしょう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「なんならわたしと一緒に小太刀を選びましょう、冴木さんに似合うと思いますよ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あたしには鉛筆削るナイフとか、彫刻刀で十分だから、別にいいよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「日本刀を使って絵を描くのも、パフォーマンスとしては面白いかもしんないけどさ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「とりあえず、面白そうなとこに行ってみよっか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ジェットコースターとか、あたし身長制限に引っかかって乗れないかもしんないけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「そうですね。せっかくの遊園地ですし、いろいろなところを回らなくてはなりませんから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「きびきびと動きましょうか。時間を有効に使うために、下調べもしてますし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「下調べしたんだ？　行き当たりばったりでもいいかなって思ってたんだけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「そういうわけにもいかないのですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「効率よくアトラクションに乗るためには、いろいろと準備が必要なのですから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「実は……いま行われている期間限定のアトラクションがすごく人気のようなので、一度行ってみたいのです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「しかし、人気のあまりに待ち時間が長く、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「通常のところなら五時間待ちは当たり前、運が良くて三時間待ちといった感じになってしまうのです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「うへ～、五時間待ち？　あたし、待ち切れなくて列から脱走しちゃうと思うんだけど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「冴木さんが退屈するのは百も承知です。だからこそ、準備もちゃんとしてきましたよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「待ち時間を短縮するための関係者用の優先チケットを、ちょうど二枚用意してきたのです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ほほう、優先チケット。それでそれで？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「冴木さんはご存じないかもしれませんが、この遊園地には円城寺財閥が融資をしているようなのです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「そのため、円城寺先輩に頼んでチケットを手配していただいたのです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「円城寺先輩も生徒会の仕事をしていたよしみで、快く渡してくれたんですよね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「開園と同時に乗り込むよりは、実はこちらのほうが効率がいいのです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「関係者用のチケットの発行と受け取りにもたしょうの時間を要しますし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「開園直後の人気アトラクションの負荷を軽減するために、午後からしか使用できないようになっているので」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「つまり、あたしがスケッチしてる間に悠木くんが優先チケットを用意してくれてたってことだよね～、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ありがとう♪」"
  },
  {
